# substrate.suite — the netsim tests: VMs are the point, not the cost.
#
# tor-link before nat-punch, and not the other way round: nat-punch mutates
# two-nodes into two-nodes-nat by moving the roster into a NAT netns, and
# nothing puts it back, so anything starting from two-nodes has to run first.
# The walk enforces this; the order is written down so the reason survives.
tor-link
nat-punch
